{
    "title": "OPA! - Family Card Game",
    "description": "Test your skills and strategies as you play OPA! - Family Card Game, and get ready to overcome fun challenges, outsmart your opponents, and win the game. \r\n\r\nPlay this fun, free OPA! - Family Card Game online and enjoy the classic game at your fingertips. \r\n\r\nWith easy-to-learn rules and simple gameplay, this game is perfect for everyone to pick up and play. Kick back and relax as you enjoy playing this game with your family and friends. Play now and show your competitive side!\r\n\r\nHow to Play?\r\n- To play a card, match it by color, number, or symbol \r\n- The first player to play all the cards in their hand wins!\r\n- WILD cards can be played on any card \r\n- Utilize wild cards to even the playing field or use power cards to increase the penalty for the next player.\r\n\r\nEnjoy your brain time as you play this classic game, and get ready for hours of fun with OPA! - Family Card Game\r\n\r\nOPA! - Family Card Game is the perfect game for any occasion. Challenge your friends and family and become the master of OPA!  Download this fun and relaxing card game and find out what the wild craze is all about!\r\n\r\nJoin the wild ride!\r\n\r\nIn this game, each player is dealt 8 cards while the remaining cards form the \"Draw Pile.\" The top card is flipped to start a \"Discard Pile.\"\r\n\r\nOn your turn, you must place a card on the Discard Pile that matches the top card's color, number, or power. You must draw from the Draw Pile if you cannot play a card. Play, then pass to the next player. \r\n\r\nStacking Rule: +2 & +2 wild power cards can be played on top of each other to increase the penalty for the next player. Remember that you may not play a +2 on a +2 wild. \r\n\r\nThe first player to get rid of all their cards wins the round. The game ends when a player reaches a set score.\r\n\r\nAre you ready? \r\nDownload today, discover unique features and challenges, and enjoy playing fun card games. \r\nTest your card-playing skills in OPA! - Family Card Game and become the ultimate victor!",
    "descriptionHTML": "Test your skills and strategies as you play OPA! - Family Card Game, and get ready to overcome fun challenges, outsmart your opponents, and win the game. <br><br>Play this fun, free OPA! - Family Card Game online and enjoy the classic game at your fingertips. <br><br>With easy-to-learn rules and simple gameplay, this game is perfect for everyone to pick up and play. Kick back and relax as you enjoy playing this game with your family and friends. Play now and show your competitive side!<br><br>How to Play?<br>- To play a card, match it by color, number, or symbol <br>- The first player to play all the cards in their hand wins!<br>- WILD cards can be played on any card <br>- Utilize wild cards to even the playing field or use power cards to increase the penalty for the next player.<br><br>Enjoy your brain time as you play this classic game, and get ready for hours of fun with OPA! - Family Card Game<br><br>OPA! - Family Card Game is the perfect game for any occasion. Challenge your friends and family and become the master of OPA!  Download this fun and relaxing card game and find out what the wild craze is all about!<br><br>Join the wild ride!<br><br>In this game, each player is dealt 8 cards while the remaining cards form the &quot;Draw Pile.&quot; The top card is flipped to start a &quot;Discard Pile.&quot;<br><br>On your turn, you must place a card on the Discard Pile that matches the top card&#39;s color, number, or power. You must draw from the Draw Pile if you cannot play a card. Play, then pass to the next player. <br><br>Stacking Rule: +2 &amp; +2 wild power cards can be played on top of each other to increase the penalty for the next player. Remember that you may not play a +2 on a +2 wild. <br><br>The first player to get rid of all their cards wins the round. The game ends when a player reaches a set score.<br><br>Are you ready? <br>Download today, discover unique features and challenges, and enjoy playing fun card games. <br>Test your card-playing skills in OPA! - Family Card Game and become the ultimate victor!",
